    the seat lift mechanism operates smoothly under the control of the beneficiary.
    the seat lift mechanism effectively assists the beneficiary in standing up and sitting down without other assistance.
    the seat lift mechanism operates by a spring release mechanism.
    the order for the seat lift mechanism was written by the treating practitioner or a consulting practitioner for the condition.
    the record of the treating practitioner documents that all appropriate therapeutic modalities were tried and failed for Gus.
    rn expects answers [].

